1
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:17,989
So many miles between where I am standing now,

2
00:00:19,199 --> 00:00:24,899
And where you are beneath another sky,

3
00:00:25,399 --> 00:00:30,230
I close my eyes and trace the space between our hands,

4
00:00:30,429 --> 00:00:37,579
So far away and I don't know why.

5
00:00:37,799 --> 00:00:43,780
The street is glowing with a golden Christmas light,

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,509
A thousand faces laughing in the freezing night,

7
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:54,640
I hold a glass that feels so empty in my palm,

8
00:00:55,170 --> 00:01:02,700
While winter winds are blowing through a quiet calm.

9
00:01:05,049 --> 00:01:11,280
You're half a world away from everything I know,

10
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:17,189
And every step I take feels heavy in the snow,

11
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:22,140
They sing of coming home to everyone they love,

12
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:29,359
While I'm just staring at the same cold stars above.

13
00:01:29,629 --> 00:01:35,709
No matter where I turn the distance pulls apart,

14
00:01:35,870 --> 00:01:41,219
Two lonely shadows with a single aching heart,

15
00:01:41,349 --> 00:01:47,189
And it hurts so deep to be apart this Christmas night,

16
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:57,379
I'm reaching out for you beyond the fading light.

17
00:02:21,069 --> 00:02:27,099
We were meant to be together where the hearth is warm,

18
00:02:27,219 --> 00:02:32,530
Instead I'm standing here alone inside the storm,

19
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:39,169
Oh how I miss you every second every mile,

20
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:50,430
Just to hold you for a moment just to.